  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个Serilum模组。充满爱意制作。Fabric、Forge和Neo上有大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Wool Tweaks 对羊毛、床和地毯的染色方式进行了各种更改。任何颜色都可以在合成网格中染色，而不仅仅是白色版本。也可以手持染料右键点击已放置的方块以改变其颜色。包含了一个将任意颜色的羊毛转换为4根线的配方。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意羊毛方块进行转换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意床方块进行转换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意地毯方块进行转换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>将任意羊毛方块合成为4根线：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>染色任意羊毛方块的颜色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>染色任意床的颜色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>染色任意地毯：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中，您就可以在任何模组包中自由使用此模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概述及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已禁用，因为我无法在如此多的独立模组页面上跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>对于问题、建议或其他事项，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
